Lab 17: Work with Automation Controller API
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

• Understand the fundamentals of the Automation Controller REST API • Use API calls to create and manage projects programmatically • Automate job template creation and execution via the API • Monitor job progress and retrieve results using API endpoints • Implement authentication and authorization for API access • Troubleshoot common API integration issues

