• Basic understanding of REST APIs and HTTP methods • Familiarity with JSON data format • Knowledge of Ansible playbooks and project structure • Experience with command-line tools like curl or wget • Understanding of authentication concepts (tokens, basic auth) • Basic Linux command-line skills

