Task 2: Create and Manage Projects via API
Subtask 2.1: List Existing Projects
Retrieve all existing projects:
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $AWX_TOKEN" \
     -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
     "$AWX_HOST/api/v2/projects/" | jq '.'
Get details of a specific project (if any exist):
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $AWX_TOKEN" \
     -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
     "$AWX_HOST/api/v2/projects/1/" | jq '.'
Subtask 2.2: Create a New Project
Create a JSON payload for the new project:
cat > project_payload.json << 'EOF'
{
  "name": "Lab17-Demo-Project",
  "description": "Demo project created via API for Lab 17",
  "organization": 1,
  "scm_type": "git",
  "scm_url": "https://github.com/ansible/ansible-examples.git",
  "scm_branch": "master",
  "scm_clean": true,
  "scm_delete_on_update": false,
  "scm_update_on_launch": true,
  "scm_update_cache_timeout": 0
